1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:19,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congyao, I've waited so long for you.</font>

3
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, lift the veil.</font>

4
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can barely breathe.</font>

5
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:44,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

6
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

7
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you lie to me?</font>

8
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you talking about?</font>

9
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Search every corner.</font>

10
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:57,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave no remnants alive here.</font>

11
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on?</font>

12
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your mother is from Xizhao.</font>

13
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:08,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you know?</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you knew all along.</font>

15
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

16
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, run!</font>

17
00:01:16,860 --> 00:01:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry about us.</font>

18
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:18,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

19
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:18,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Run!</font>

20
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:19,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother!</font>

21
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, Mother!</font>

22
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father, Mother!</font>

23
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:33,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- After them!
- Stop!</font>

24
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:34,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

25
00:01:34,940 --> 00:01:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Stop!
- Stop!</font>

26
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:36,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

27
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

28
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:39,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop running!</font>

29
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there someone</font>

30
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you long to love but dare not,</font>

31
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:50,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and long to hate but cannot?</font>

32
00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

33
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if my family is fated to be destroyed,
I'll accept it.</font>

34
00:01:54,980 --> 00:01:56,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not,</font>

35
00:01:56,860 --> 00:01:58,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will make you pay in blood.</font>

36
00:01:59,060 --> 00:01:59,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father,</font>

37
00:01:59,780 --> 00:02:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother,</font>

38
00:02:00,820 --> 00:02:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I survive,</font>

39
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll find my brother</font>

40
00:02:04,780 --> 00:02:06,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and clear our family's name.</font>

41
00:02:07,260 --> 00:02:12,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 1]</font>

42
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:27,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Double Happiness]</font>

43
00:02:28,420 --> 00:02:29,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
the bridal escort has arrived.</font>

44
00:02:29,980 --> 00:02:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shall we receive them?</font>

45
00:02:46,140 --> 00:02:46,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Receive?</font>

46
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Receive which one?</font>

47
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What bad luck. I'll handle it.</font>

48
00:03:01,220 --> 00:03:01,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

49
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:03,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're both joyous occasions.</font>

50
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:05,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the difference</font>

51
00:03:05,940 --> 00:03:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between their joy and mine?</font>

52
00:03:08,340 --> 00:03:09,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't spoil their fun.</font>

53
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you don't want to receive her,</font>

54
00:03:10,620 --> 00:03:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go finish her off for you.</font>

55
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:13,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a dying man.</font>

56
00:03:14,180 --> 00:03:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If my marrying the Xizhao Princess</font>

57
00:03:15,340 --> 00:03:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">could bring peace
between our two nations,</font>

58
00:03:18,140 --> 00:03:19,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't that ease His Majesty's burden?</font>

59
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is the deceased?</font>

60
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who is your master?</font>

61
00:05:08,580 --> 00:05:09,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi.</font>

62
00:05:17,060 --> 00:05:18,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was just one cut.</font>

63
00:05:18,700 --> 00:05:20,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to see</font>

64
00:05:21,820 --> 00:05:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how many more you can take.</font>

65
00:05:30,940 --> 00:05:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He took poison.</font>

66
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drag him away.</font>

67
00:05:42,180 --> 00:05:43,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Next.</font>

68
00:05:49,220 --> 00:05:50,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You.</font>

69
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:52,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring her up.</font>

70
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:23,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anything left to say?</font>

71
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:26,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, I...</font>

72
00:06:26,740 --> 00:06:27,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just a coroner.</font>

73
00:06:28,300 --> 00:06:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I serve at the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

74
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:32,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deputy Mr. Jiang Yufan is my chief.</font>

75
00:06:33,260 --> 00:06:34,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday, I just wanted to slack off,</font>

76
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I hid in a coffin to sleep.</font>

77
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:39,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who knew something
like this would happen?</font>

78
00:06:45,100 --> 00:06:46,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sleeping in a coffin?</font>

79
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:49,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My home is at Yizhuang.</font>

80
00:06:50,540 --> 00:06:52,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've been around corpses
since childhood.</font>

81
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:54,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's all routine to me.</font>

82
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She doesn't faint at the sight of blood.</font>

83
00:07:02,220 --> 00:07:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

84
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:10,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

85
00:07:15,060 --> 00:07:17,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I failed.
Please punish me, Your Highness.</font>

86
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't blame you.</font>

87
00:07:22,180 --> 00:07:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao is cunning and bloodthirsty.</font>

88
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:27,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At the border, he slaughtered
countless Xizhao warriors.</font>

89
00:07:29,620 --> 00:07:30,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even my Zhou...</font>

90
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You escaped his clutches.</font>

91
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should count yourself lucky.</font>

92
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what do we do now?</font>

93
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you really going</font>

94
00:07:41,780 --> 00:07:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to marry Li Congyao?</font>

95
00:07:44,180 --> 00:07:46,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Li Congyao withdrew
from the Guanzhou border,</font>

96
00:07:46,740 --> 00:07:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he claimed his blood cough syndrome
had relapsed,</font>

97
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he needed to return
to the capital to recover.</font>

98
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:52,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But when I saw him on the street,</font>

99
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:54,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw at once that he was afflicted
with Bloodlure Poison.</font>

100
00:07:55,340 --> 00:07:56,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bloodlure Poison?</font>

101
00:07:57,340 --> 00:07:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that the long-lost</font>

102
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xizhao poison?</font>

103
00:08:01,780 --> 00:08:04,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With so many enemies,
revenge must be swift.</font>

104
00:08:05,380 --> 00:08:07,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No antidote exists.</font>

105
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:09,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as I can watch him</font>

106
00:08:09,580 --> 00:08:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">die in agony before my eyes,</font>

107
00:08:13,020 --> 00:08:14,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">marrying him is a small price.</font>

108
00:08:14,780 --> 00:08:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

109
00:08:17,140 --> 00:08:17,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

110
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:20,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those assassins
would rather die than talk.</font>

111
00:08:21,820 --> 00:08:24,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine. Just for show.</font>

112
00:08:25,180 --> 00:08:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We both know</font>

113
00:08:27,420 --> 00:08:28,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who their master is.</font>

114
00:08:29,860 --> 00:08:31,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought, for both nations' sake,</font>

115
00:08:31,620 --> 00:08:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd let her in</font>

116
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and keep to ourselves,
so all would be well.</font>

117
00:08:37,260 --> 00:08:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now she strikes first.</font>

118
00:08:40,940 --> 00:08:41,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what to do,</font>

119
00:08:42,860 --> 00:08:43,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't you?</font>

120
00:08:47,900 --> 00:08:48,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, I do.</font>

121
00:09:12,300 --> 00:09:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

122
00:09:14,220 --> 00:09:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">today I saw someone with eyes</font>

123
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">very much like yours.</font>

124
00:09:22,420 --> 00:09:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

125
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:23,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang...</font>

126
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

127
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to disturb you so late.</font>

128
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:30,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've come to ask about someone.</font>

129
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Don't run!
- Stop!</font>

130
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

131
00:09:42,900 --> 00:09:44,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, are you alright?</font>

132
00:09:44,940 --> 00:09:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, how did you find me?</font>

133
00:09:47,860 --> 00:09:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd find you anywhere.</font>

134
00:09:49,660 --> 00:09:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With me here, no one dares bully you.</font>

135
00:09:52,340 --> 00:09:54,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing you arrived in time.</font>

136
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, I'd have made
a grave mistake.</font>

137
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't put it that way.</font>

138
00:09:59,060 --> 00:10:00,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my failure to discipline my people.</font>

139
00:10:01,420 --> 00:10:03,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take her back now.</font>

140
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:05,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, let's go.</font>

141
00:10:05,420 --> 00:10:06,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

142
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, any other orders?</font>

143
00:10:17,540 --> 00:10:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all.</font>

144
00:10:19,140 --> 00:10:19,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

145
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:22,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What did he mean?</font>

146
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't ask. Let's go.</font>

147
00:10:34,260 --> 00:10:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congyao, you're finally back.</font>

148
00:10:37,020 --> 00:10:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you have any idea</font>

149
00:10:38,420 --> 00:10:39,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how long I've waited for you?</font>

150
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silly girl, why are you standing
on the threshold?</font>

151
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come down now.</font>

152
00:10:48,860 --> 00:10:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen, it's a taboo.</font>

153
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:52,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every time you step on the threshold,</font>

154
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:53,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you take on the sins</font>

155
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of that household.</font>

156
00:10:55,580 --> 00:10:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The more you step,</font>

157
00:10:56,860 --> 00:10:58,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the more you bear.</font>

158
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:03,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's your family's sins,</font>

159
00:11:03,740 --> 00:11:04,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll bear them willingly.</font>

160
00:11:07,060 --> 00:11:07,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nonsense.</font>

161
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:12,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jinyu Chamber]</font>

162
00:11:24,060 --> 00:11:25,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, time to rise.</font>

163
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness?</font>

164
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:34,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

165
00:11:41,540 --> 00:11:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

166
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:45,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone! Come quickly!</font>

167
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:47,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come quickly!</font>

168
00:11:49,860 --> 00:11:51,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hanyuan Hall]</font>

169
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:55,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

170
00:11:56,980 --> 00:11:58,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the Li family's sole heir.</font>

171
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:00,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet you delay taking a wife.</font>

172
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had to be concerned.</font>

173
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I chose this match with care.</font>

174
00:12:06,460 --> 00:12:07,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who could have foreseen this?</font>

175
00:12:08,820 --> 00:12:09,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you blame me?</font>

176
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand your intentions.</font>

177
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:27,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That you see it so</font>

178
00:12:28,060 --> 00:12:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">brings me great comfort.</font>

179
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:32,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the Princess
had just arrived in Beiyuan.</font>

180
00:12:33,220 --> 00:12:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She wouldn't have made enemies so soon.</font>

181
00:12:35,340 --> 00:12:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A sudden death is highly suspicious.</font>

182
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard</font>

183
00:12:39,860 --> 00:12:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there were assassins
the day you received the bride.</font>

184
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:43,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know who sent them?</font>

185
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:46,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Those assassins were after me.</font>

186
00:12:47,260 --> 00:12:48,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As you know,</font>

187
00:12:48,460 --> 00:12:49,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my duties have made me many enemies.</font>

188
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Too many people want me dead.</font>

189
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the Princess died in Beiyuan.</font>

190
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:00,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must give Xizhao an answer.</font>

191
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:02,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao Princess died unjustly.</font>

192
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:06,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you to let me lead
this investigation.</font>

193
00:13:06,300 --> 00:13:08,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, you can't go in!</font>

194
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be held accountable!</font>

195
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:12,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's such a grave matter.</font>

196
00:13:12,500 --> 00:13:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you tell me?</font>

197
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:18,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could help share the burden.</font>

198
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:30,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun!</font>

199
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:32,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun!</font>

200
00:13:32,540 --> 00:13:33,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That poison-wielding menace is here.</font>

201
00:13:33,820 --> 00:13:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move, move!</font>

202
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, hurry!</font>

203
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi.</font>

204
00:13:37,540 --> 00:13:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hello.</font>

205
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks for the hard work.</font>

206
00:13:40,380 --> 00:13:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

207
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:44,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're here.</font>

208
00:13:47,780 --> 00:13:48,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened to your hand?</font>

209
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:51,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing. I got some paint on it.</font>

210
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way, Jun,</font>

211
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:55,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard someone was bullying you.</font>

212
00:13:55,780 --> 00:13:56,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I pestered Jiang Yufan all day,</font>

213
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but he wouldn't say a word.</font>

214
00:13:58,100 --> 00:13:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me what happened.</font>

215
00:13:59,460 --> 00:14:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't afford to cross this person.</font>

216
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:01,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impossible.</font>

217
00:14:02,020 --> 00:14:03,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no one in Yanjing
I can't handle.</font>

218
00:14:03,860 --> 00:14:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, don't be afraid. Speak freely.</font>

219
00:14:05,620 --> 00:14:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

220
00:14:06,900 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

221
00:14:09,580 --> 00:14:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

222
00:14:10,740 --> 00:14:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the merciless man</font>

223
00:14:11,660 --> 00:14:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who kills without blinking?</font>

224
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:17,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, listen.</font>

225
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:20,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't afford to cross him.</font>

226
00:14:20,820 --> 00:14:22,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep our distance from now on.</font>

227
00:14:22,540 --> 00:14:25,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've heard his heart is stone.</font>

228
00:14:25,460 --> 00:14:27,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He killed his newlywed wife.</font>

229
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:29,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if she was an enemy spy,</font>

230
00:14:29,460 --> 00:14:30,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they had loved each other.</font>

231
00:14:31,540 --> 00:14:33,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could he do it with his own hands?</font>

232
00:14:33,700 --> 00:14:34,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's terrifying.</font>

233
00:14:37,660 --> 00:14:38,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's such a story?</font>

234
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:40,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You hadn't heard?</font>

235
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It caused a huge stir back then.</font>

236
00:14:43,620 --> 00:14:45,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After that,
he rose swiftly through the ranks</font>

237
00:14:45,820 --> 00:14:46,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and was granted a title.</font>

238
00:14:47,700 --> 00:14:48,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I've also heard</font>

239
00:14:48,580 --> 00:14:51,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he contracted blood cough syndrome.</font>

240
00:14:51,780 --> 00:14:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why he always looks so sickly.</font>

241
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:55,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His whole family died of it.</font>

242
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I reckon he hasn't got long either.</font>

243
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:03,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

244
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:05,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we didn't know you had arrived.</font>

245
00:15:05,940 --> 00:15:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forgive our failure to welcome you.</font>

246
00:15:07,820 --> 00:15:09,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know if I might have</font>

247
00:15:10,220 --> 00:15:11,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a word with Ms. Jun</font>

248
00:15:11,780 --> 00:15:12,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in private?</font>

249
00:15:13,020 --> 00:15:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, of course.</font>

250
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:15,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

251
00:15:38,780 --> 00:15:41,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, what brings you here?</font>

252
00:15:44,700 --> 00:15:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao Princess,</font>

253
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:47,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sent for the marriage alliance with me,</font>

254
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is dead.</font>

255
00:15:49,820 --> 00:15:51,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can she be dead?</font>

256
00:15:52,900 --> 00:15:54,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This concerns</font>

257
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:55,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the diplomatic relations
between our two nations.</font>

258
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Has His Majesty decided</font>

259
00:15:57,300 --> 00:15:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who will oversee the investigation?</font>

260
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:00,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to know?</font>

261
00:16:03,140 --> 00:16:03,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take off your clothes.</font>

262
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want me to help you?</font>

263
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:13,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
are you overcome with grief?</font>

264
00:16:16,460 --> 00:16:17,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

265
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:20,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me go.</font>

266
00:16:26,820 --> 00:16:27,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you let go?</font>

267
00:16:29,940 --> 00:16:30,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you kill me,</font>

268
00:16:32,100 --> 00:16:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Court of Judicial Review
won't escape blame.</font>

269
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:38,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead, stab.</font>

270
00:16:47,180 --> 00:16:48,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just like everyone else.</font>

271
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:50,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You all want me dead, don't you?</font>

272
00:16:51,180 --> 00:16:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You humiliated me first.</font>

273
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:55,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One prefers death</font>

274
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to humiliation.</font>

275
00:17:12,860 --> 00:17:13,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The one overseeing this investigation</font>

276
00:17:15,300 --> 00:17:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is Changle.</font>

277
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:21,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle.</font>

278
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wonderful.</font>

279
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:30,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the day I've been waiting for.</font>

280
00:17:31,060 --> 00:17:33,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Court of Judicial Review]</font>

281
00:17:33,940 --> 00:17:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

282
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:36,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What happened?</font>

283
00:17:36,580 --> 00:17:37,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who did this?</font>

284
00:17:38,940 --> 00:17:39,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

285
00:17:39,820 --> 00:17:40,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill her.</font>

286
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:41,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

287
00:17:43,820 --> 00:17:45,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked for her clothes first.</font>

288
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:46,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She resisted.</font>

289
00:17:47,460 --> 00:17:47,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only natural.</font>

290
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:49,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you go to her for the case?</font>

291
00:17:50,460 --> 00:17:51,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not the case that matters.</font>

292
00:17:52,540 --> 00:17:53,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's her.</font>

293
00:18:04,460 --> 00:18:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, we have word.</font>

294
00:18:06,580 --> 00:18:07,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak.</font>

295
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Jun from Yizhuang</font>

296
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:09,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was originally from Minning.</font>

297
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:11,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her husband died five years ago.</font>

298
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She took her child</font>

299
00:18:13,060 --> 00:18:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and moved to Yanjing.</font>

300
00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And this child</font>

301
00:18:15,900 --> 00:18:17,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is Jun Qinglan.</font>

302
00:18:20,380 --> 00:18:21,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Minning Village.</font>

303
00:18:22,140 --> 00:18:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guanzhou?</font>

304
00:18:23,420 --> 00:18:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

305
00:18:24,580 --> 00:18:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And before that,</font>

306
00:18:25,780 --> 00:18:26,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan fell gravely ill.</font>

307
00:18:27,700 --> 00:18:29,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The villagers said she wouldn't make it.</font>

308
00:18:30,340 --> 00:18:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Later,</font>

309
00:18:31,380 --> 00:18:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they moved away.</font>

310
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:33,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well done.</font>

311
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:34,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may go.</font>

312
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:35,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

313
00:18:39,860 --> 00:18:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

314
00:18:40,860 --> 00:18:41,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why this sudden interest</font>

315
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a coroner?</font>

316
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:44,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps Qin Wei isn't dead.</font>

317
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:46,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mean Jun Qinglan?</font>

318
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But her appearance...</font>

319
00:18:49,660 --> 00:18:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Appearances can be changed.</font>

320
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:53,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So can one's voice.</font>

321
00:18:54,140 --> 00:18:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei's birthmark below the collarbone</font>

322
00:18:56,860 --> 00:18:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the surest way for me</font>

323
00:18:57,900 --> 00:18:58,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to confirm her identity.</font>

324
00:19:05,630 --> 00:19:07,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

325
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

326
00:19:10,170 --> 00:19:13,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

327
00:19:14,090 --> 00:19:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

328
00:19:18,770 --> 00:19:22,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

329
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:26,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

330
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:31,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

331
00:19:31,610 --> 00:19:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

332
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:44,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

333
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:47,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

334
00:19:48,470 --> 00:19:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

335
00:19:53,020 --> 00:19:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

336
00:19:56,990 --> 00:20:01,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

337
00:20:01,590 --> 00:20:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
